{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52106","headline":"五言[仪鸾殿]早秋侍宴应诏 · 长孙无忌","name":"五言[仪鸾殿]早秋侍宴应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金飙扇徂暑，玉露下层台。\n接绶芳筵合，临池紫殿开。\n日斜林影去，风度荷香来。\n既承百吴味酒，愿上万年杯。\n（《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗原署：「司空赵国公臣长孙无忌上。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙无忌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}